WEBVTT

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.823
originally as a corporate participant

00:02:31.847 --> 00:02:34.180
and more recently as an ambassador.

00:02:35.403 --> 00:02:37.172
Now, B Corps are a group of companies

00:02:37.196 --> 00:02:40.116
who believe in business
as a force for good.

00:02:40.649 --> 00:02:44.395
There's a tough certification
with about 250 questions

00:02:44.419 --> 00:02:47.685
about your social
and environmental performance.

00:02:48.069 --> 00:02:50.426
You must legally declare your intention

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:53.410
to serve the community
as well as your shareholders

00:02:53.434 --> 00:02:57.323
and you must sign
the declaration of interdependence.

00:02:58.427 --> 00:03:00.903
Now one of the things
that inspires me the most